{"path":"experimental/gcd","title":"std::experimental::gcd","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::</span>gcd","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/gcd","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"Computes the greatest common divisor of the integers m and n.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code>&lt;experimental/numeric&gt;</code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-libfund_ts_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> M, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/common_type\"><span class=\"kw641\">std::<span class=\"me2\">common_type_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>M, N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> gcd<span class=\"br0\">(</span> M m, N n <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts-2 t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS v2)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Computes the greatest common divisor of the integers <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">m</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> m, n\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> integer values\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>If both <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">m</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n</span></code> are zero, returns zero. Otherwise, returns the greatest common divisor of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy3\">|</span>m<span class=\"sy3\">|</span></span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy3\">|</span>n<span class=\"sy3\">|</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Remarks\">Remarks</h3>\n<p>If either <code>M</code> or <code>N</code> is not an integer type, or if either is (possibly cv-qualified) <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span></span></code>, the program is ill-formed.\n</p><p>If either <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy3\">|</span>m<span class=\"sy3\">|</span></span></code> or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy3\">|</span>n<span class=\"sy3\">|</span></span></code> is not representable as a value of type <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/common_type\"><span class=\"kw641\">std::<span class=\"me2\">common_type_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>M, N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>, the behavior is undefined.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>Throws no exceptions.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/lcm\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>lcm</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   <code>constexpr</code> function template returning the least common multiple of two integers  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Remarks","id":"Remarks"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::experimental::gcd","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Computes the greatest common divisor of the integers m and n."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"m, n"},{"label":"Return value","note":"If both m and n are zero, returns zero. Otherwise, returns the greatest common divisor of |m| and |n|."},{"label":"Remarks","note":"If either M or N is not an integer type, or if either is (possibly cv-qualified) bool, the program is ill-formed."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"Throws no exceptions."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"lcm","note":"constexpr function template returning the least common multiple of two integers"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":120,"codeBlockCount":0}
